{"v":4,"catch":"著名的數字拼圖“SUDOKU”具有普遍的吸引力！","desc":"“Sudoku”是一個拼圖，您可以將 1 到 9 的數字放入一個 9x9 的網格中，分為水平和垂直線以及 3x3 塊，用數字填充所有空間。 從簡單的謎題到超難的謎題，這款遊戲深受從初學者到老手的廣大玩家的歡迎。 請享受這款高品質的數獨遊戲。\n\n選項菜單、手冊和其他文本有日語、英語、法語、德語、意大利語和西班牙語版本。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-09-15","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","訓練","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca390289cb88ad929b89b0f7dd4fe2f92346df121d83725b3b263347fb05a513.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dbfcdcb096c17de333ead8eb38db09c95cf4b8fa168adff292544067d0a42b33.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0645a460888fcd728a90611524ccace65b8da08c815ae7d90c2537dcb2bb5319.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f17304feeeccd41df44510d0e7d1d888d79372050475caebcedd3c1dea044a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/238597e02989605c3c0d7873a14266083dfd1d17763bd995aa03c9aa2226c28a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a542dbc8e577d7c3abdf0c96f5351be084d5bda6f1bb155c2cc2244d31539ac2.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d6900e3d6000","dlc":[]}